<title>POLAND: CHEMISKOR SWINGS TO PROFIT IN JUNE.</title>
<headline>CHEMISKOR SWINGS TO PROFIT IN JUNE.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results June</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JUNE		     1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.03 vs   0.03 loss</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.06 vs   0.02 loss</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.02 vs   0.02</p>
<p> Sales		    1.01 vs   0.64</p>
<p> JANUARY-JUNE	   1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.55 vs   0.21</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 2.51 vs   0.37</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.68 vs   0.43</p>
<p> Sales		    8.23 vs   6.15</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish leather goods maker is Chemiskor</p>
<p>SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
